From 08eac827982e789cb06a915b2495bb64706fbb16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:44:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] sim: v850: Match the RH850 FPU behaviour

Reach the FPU system registers without bank selection, round fused
multiply add to single precision, decode the rounding mode, flush
subnormals, and record flags, NaN results and zero signs as RH850 does.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
---
